{
  "about": "Shared verdict cases for mapping_profile_v2 section rules. Each case is the base profile mapping/prim8_natural_v1.json (sha256 ec285a50...) with `schema` and `sections` replaced (a missing `sections` key removes it). Spine tests/profile_rules_parity.test.js and PRISM tools/test_per_section_mapping.js carry byte-identical copies of this file and check their validators against `ok`.",
